        "updated_at": "2025-02-20T18:47:20Z",
        "body": "Hi, thank you for your interest in our work and raising this issue! We have added the `detectron2/data/datasets` directory. This is not directly used by our model, as SegLLM only uses HIPIE (which uses detectron2) as a mask decoder. However, we have included this folder in the latest update in order to avoid any import issues. Thanks!",
